WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.498 --> 00:00:07.197
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SHOCKING NEW VIDEO

00:00:07.198 --> 00:00:08.265
TENTATIVE A JOURNALIST BEING

00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:08.866
ATTACKED ON THE JOB.

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:11.535
SURVEILLANCE VIDEO SHOWING THE

00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:12.870
MAN BEING ACCOSTED AND ACCOSTED

00:00:12.871 --> 00:00:15.372
AND FORCIBLY REMOVED FROM A

00:00:15.373 --> 00:00:18.609
PUBLIC SPEAKING EVENT FOR NONE

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.477
OTHER THAN AMERICAN URBAN RADIO

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:22.546
NETWORK AND CNN'S APRIL RYAN,

00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:24.848
WHO IRONICALLY IS KNOWN TO BE A

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:25.749
CHAMPION FOR PRESS FREEDOM.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.785
WATCH THIS.

00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:29.553
&gt;&gt; HELLO.

00:00:29.554 --> 00:00:34.925
TO ALL OF YOU, WHEN I --

00:00:34.926 --> 00:00:39.029
&gt;&gt; DON'T TOUCH MY CAMERA, PLEAS

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:39.363
PLEASE.

00:00:39.364 --> 00:00:41.231
DON'T YOU DARE, PUT THAT DOWN.

00:00:41.232 --> 00:00:45.569
IF THAT'S MY.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:55.079
&gt;&gt; HOW DARE YOU COME IN HERE.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:01:04.588
[INDISTINCT SHOUTING]

00:01:04.589 --> 00:01:05.255
&gt;&gt; Jesse: JOINING ME NOW

00:01:05.256 --> 00:01:07.791
EXCLUSIVELY IS THE MAN IN THAT

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:10.394
VIDEO, THE EDITOR OF NEW

00:01:10.395 --> 00:01:11.362
BRUNSWICK TODAY.

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.030
ALL RIGHT, CHARLIE, YOU WENT

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:13.797
INTO THIS EVENT WERE APRIL RYAN

00:01:13.798 --> 00:01:16.567
WAS GOING TO BE SPEAKING, WANTED

00:01:16.568 --> 00:01:19.770
TO COVER IT FROM A STRAIGHT NEWS

00:01:19.771 --> 00:01:20.437
PUT PERSPECTIVE.

00:01:20.438 --> 00:01:21.438
YOU GOT CREDENTIALED.

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:23.273
NO ONE EVER TOLD YOU, OR IT WAS

00:01:23.274 --> 00:01:25.242
NEVER WRITTEN THAT THERE WAS NO

00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:26.377
FILMING, AND THEN WHAT HAPPENED?

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:28.612
&gt;&gt; I WAS THERE WITH MY CAMERA ON

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:30.047
A TRIPOD, RIGHT NEXT TO ANOTHER

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:32.816
CAMERA ON A TRIPOD.

00:01:32.817 --> 00:01:34.184
I ENJOYED THE EVENING FOR A

00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:35.519
COUPLE HOURS, THEN THIS FELLOW

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.222
CAME UP TO ME AND STARTED, YOU

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:39.723
KNOW, ASK ME WHO I WAS, WHY IS

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:43.227
YOUR CAMERA HERE, AND I GAVE HIM

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:44.695
MY BUSINESS CARD, EXPLAINED, AND

00:01:44.696 --> 00:01:46.430
HE TOLD ME IF I DON'T TAKE THAT

00:01:46.431 --> 00:01:47.398
CAMERA DOWN, HE WILL TAKE THE

00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:48.632
CAMERA DOWN FOR ME.

00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:49.900
ONE THING LED TO ANOTHER, HE

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.769
GRABBED THE CAMERA AND

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.937
HIGHTAILED IT OUT OF THE ROOM.

00:01:53.938 --> 00:01:56.040
&gt;&gt; Jesse: REALLY YOU THE ONLY

00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:56.907
ONE BOOTED OUT OF, OTHERS LEFT A

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:57.207
FILM?

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:59.209
&gt;&gt; I WAS THE ONLY ONE, AND I

00:01:59.210 --> 00:01:59.943
WASN'T BOOTED, I VOLUNTARILY

00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:03.680
LEFT BECAUSE HE STOLE MY CAMERA.

00:02:03.681 --> 00:02:05.182
&gt;&gt; Jesse: OTHER PEOPLE WERE

00:02:05.183 --> 00:02:07.151
ABLE TO FILM AND YOU WEREN'T?

00:02:07.152 --> 00:02:09.053
&gt;&gt; THERE WERE OTHER PEOPLE WITH

00:02:09.054 --> 00:02:09.787
VIDEO AND TAKING PICTURES.

00:02:09.788 --> 00:02:12.089
&gt;&gt; Jesse: MAY BE THEY MISTOOK

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:12.489
YOU FOR ME.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:15.025
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW WHAT THE

00:02:15.026 --> 00:02:17.227
MISUNDERSTANDING WAS, BUT I WAS

00:02:17.228 --> 00:02:17.861
DEFINITELY FELT VIOLATED.

00:02:17.862 --> 00:02:19.530
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SO IT WAS A

00:02:19.531 --> 00:02:21.398
BODYGUARD, YOU BELIEVE, OF APRIL

00:02:21.399 --> 00:02:21.698
RYAN.

00:02:21.699 --> 00:02:23.901
&gt;&gt; YES, THAT IS WHAT THE POLICE

00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:24.968
WERE TOLD.

00:02:24.969 --> 00:02:28.305
MISS RYAN'S SECURITY GUARD, JOE

00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:28.639
MORRIS.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.141
&gt;&gt; Jesse: AND HE PUT HIS HANDS

00:02:31.142 --> 00:02:31.475
ON YOU?

00:02:31.476 --> 00:02:31.809
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.811
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHAT DID HE DO

00:02:33.812 --> 00:02:34.578
SPECIFICALLY PHYSICALLY TO YOU?

00:02:34.579 --> 00:02:36.647
&gt;&gt; I WAS ABLE TO RETRIEVE THE

00:02:36.648 --> 00:02:37.414
CAMERA, AS YOU CAN SEE IN THE

00:02:37.415 --> 00:02:38.949
VIDEO, AND THEN HE WON'T GIVE ME

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.718
ANY SPACE, STAYS RIGHT NEAR ME.

00:02:41.719 --> 00:02:43.020
I'M TRYING TO USE THE CAMERA TO

00:02:43.021 --> 00:02:45.055
GET AN IMAGE OF HIM, TO MAKE

00:02:45.056 --> 00:02:47.291
SURE I GET -- DOCUMENT WHO HE

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:48.992
IS, AND HE DOESN'T WANT THAT TO

00:02:48.993 --> 00:02:50.327
HAPPEN, SO HE IS STICKING HIS

00:02:50.328 --> 00:02:51.595
HAND IN THE FACE OF THE CAMERA,

00:02:51.596 --> 00:02:54.665
HITTING THE MICROPHONE, AND I

00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:57.668
KIND OF SNUCK AWAY TO GET SOME

00:02:57.669 --> 00:03:00.037
SPACE FROM HIM, AND HE CHASED ME

00:03:00.038 --> 00:03:01.071
DOWN, GRABBED MY ARM, TWISTED MY

00:03:01.072 --> 00:03:06.577
ARM BEHIND MY BACK.

00:03:06.578 --> 00:03:07.044
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WOW.

00:03:07.045 --> 00:03:08.979
AND YOU ARE NOT AN IDEOLOGICAL

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:09.646
OPPONENT OF MISS RYAN.

00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.315
&gt;&gt; WHEN I LEFT THE HOUSE THAT

00:03:11.316 --> 00:03:13.050
DAY, I WAS A FAN OF HERS.

00:03:13.051 --> 00:03:14.451
I WAS LOOKING FORWARD TO SEEING

00:03:14.452 --> 00:03:15.986
HER REMARKS, MAY BE LEARNING A

00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:17.387
THING OR TWO SINCE SHE HAS BEEN

00:03:17.388 --> 00:03:19.790
A JOURNALIST LONGER THAN I HAVE.

00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:21.024
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SO THE PRESS

00:03:21.025 --> 00:03:22.860
ATTACKED FREEDOM OF THE PRESS,

00:03:22.861 --> 00:03:23.360
IN YOUR OPINION?

00:03:23.361 --> 00:03:26.330
&gt;&gt; THIS WAS AN ATTACK ON OUR

00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:28.198
FREEDOMS, YES, ABSOLUTELY.

00:03:28.199 --> 00:03:28.699
THIS CANNOT STAND.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.834
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WE REACHED OUT TO

00:03:30.835 --> 00:03:32.769
HEAR FROM APRIL RYAN.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:36.406
SHE HAS NOT EXERCISED HER

00:03:36.407 --> 00:03:37.274
FIRST AMENDMENT RIGHTS, AND

00:03:37.275 --> 00:03:38.575
NEITHER HAS CNN.

00:03:38.576 --> 00:03:40.978
NEITHER HAS AMERICAN URBAN RADIO

00:03:40.979 --> 00:03:43.147
NETWORKS.

00:03:43.148 --> 00:03:43.914
UNFORTUNATELY, SHE IS JUST GOING

00:03:43.915 --> 00:03:46.016
TO TRY TO RIDE THIS OUT, I

00:03:46.017 --> 00:03:47.284
GUESS, AND PRETEND IT HAS NOT

00:03:47.285 --> 00:03:48.318
HAPPENED, EVEN THOUGH IT IS ALL

00:03:48.319 --> 00:03:50.120
OVER THE INTERNET.

00:03:50.121 --> 00:03:52.222
I THINK WE HAVE A TWEET FROM HER

00:03:52.223 --> 00:03:53.457
FROM A LITTLE WHILE BACK, CAN WE

00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:56.393
PUT THIS TWEET UP?

00:03:56.394 --> 00:03:58.462
IT SAYS "I HAVE NEVER SEEN

00:03:58.463 --> 00:04:00.130
ANYTHING LIKE THIS IN THIS

00:04:00.131 --> 00:04:02.399
COUNTRY BY A PRESIDENT AND HIS

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.468
ADMINISTRATION -- SPEAKING OF

00:04:04.469 --> 00:04:04.768
TRUMP.

00:04:04.769 --> 00:04:06.436
FREEDOM OF THE PRESS, WE ARE NOT

00:04:06.437 --> 00:04:07.304
IN RUSSIA OR CHINA.

00:04:07.305 --> 00:04:09.439
OUR JOBS ARE TO ASK QUESTIONS.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:10.340
A LOT OF TIMES QUESTIONS THEY

00:04:10.341 --> 00:04:11.375
DON'T LIKE.

00:04:11.376 --> 00:04:14.645
WHAT IN THE WORLD."

00:04:14.646 --> 00:04:16.813
THAT'S FROM LAST JULY.

00:04:16.814 --> 00:04:17.781
AND SHE'S ACCUSING THE TRUMP

00:04:17.782 --> 00:04:18.482
ADMINISTRATION OF BEING LIKE

00:04:18.483 --> 00:04:21.285
CHINA AND RUSSIA.

00:04:21.286 --> 00:04:23.987
AND THEN, IN AUGUST 2019, SHE

00:04:23.988 --> 00:04:26.623
HERSELF, AND HER SQUAD, ACTS

00:04:26.624 --> 00:04:28.859
LIKE CHINA AND RUSSIA.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:29.693
THINK THAT IS HYPOCRITICAL?

00:04:29.694 --> 00:04:32.629
&gt;&gt; I THINK THIS IS SUPREMELY

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.298
IRONIC AND UNEXPECTED, AND

00:04:34.299 --> 00:04:36.233
CERTAINLY NOT BEHAVIOR THAT IS

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:37.034
BEFITTING SOMEBODY WHO KNOWS

00:04:37.035 --> 00:04:37.634
JOURNALISM.

00:04:37.635 --> 00:04:38.435
TO SOMEBODY WHO HAS BEEN IN THE

00:04:38.436 --> 00:04:39.570
FIELD FOR A LONG TIME.

00:04:39.571 --> 00:04:41.805
SHE WOULDN'T WANT TO BE TREATED

00:04:41.806 --> 00:04:43.240
LIKE THAT, SO I DON'T SEE WHY

00:04:43.241 --> 00:04:44.408
SHE CAN COME IN TO MY COMMUNITY,

00:04:44.409 --> 00:04:45.475
AND HAVE HER PEOPLE COME AND

00:04:45.476 --> 00:04:49.680
VIOLATE OUR LAWS LIKE THAT.

00:04:49.681 --> 00:04:53.418
AN ATTACK FREEDOM OF THE PRESS.

